|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| broad prior 0.35 ± 0.15 m | 26.6% | 34.4% | 4.5% | 21.0% | 20.2% | 63.57 | -22.4% | 11 | 54% | 3% | 26.3% |
| tight prior 0.35 ± 0.03 m | 23.4% | 31.9% | 4.3% | 25.5% | 25.5% | 45.44 | -19.8% | 0 | 38% | 0% | 23.0% |
