Runs > 25% / > 50%: share of the runs (with scored samples after 10 s) whose per-run RMS exceeds it. Counting NaN runs as failures too: broad prior 0.35 ± 0.15 m 54% / 3%; tight prior 0.35 ± 0.03 m 38% / 0%; wrong prior 58% / 1%.

